Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.98,0:09:11.23,Screen,1,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\bord2\blur1\shad0\fax-0.38\an2\3c&H000000&\3a&H6A&\pos(604.8,789.066)\frz10.04}我爱你！直到永远！
