Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.99,0:09:14.74,Default,1,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\bord2\blur2\shad0\fax-0\an1\3c&H000000&\3a&H19&\pos(147.429,375.429)\frz16.91}国王大人的耳朵\N跟驴一样
